    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "So that's it... Sona and them were doing such things..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "The Infected fighters' arena. I'd heard of this competition format... No, this cannot even be considered a 'format'."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Whether or not they come from a knight family, anyone can become a competition knight, earn the recognition of the Knights Association through their grit and become a noble..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "But the Infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "They'll let the Infected join the competitions, but there's no country that would let an Infected become a pillar of society. That's why they're segregated in another competition format."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "The Infected can earn money and live on, but they'll forever be simple gladiators trying to entertain the masses... Tch. There ain't any meaning to such a sideshow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Oh, I don't mean anything by that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "You old geezer, can't you be more tactful with your words?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Who in hell am I supposed to be tactful for, huh? They're almost onto us!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "The Infected matter is worrying, but... now is not the time to be worrying about them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "...Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "They changed their fate as Infected through their own tenacity... But they've saved many people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "If we want to change anything, we will have to continue moving forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "...Little Maria has become a respectable knight capable of such words... If only Margaret could see this, surely she would be gratified..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Don't speak of the Radiant Knight like she's dead, you idiot!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "You're the one twisting my words, Kowal!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Maria? What's wrong?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "N-Nothing!"
    },
