    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "What's up, V? Focus on driving. Don't make me get out and call a taxi."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "I'm just thinking about those two squirrels... If you get out now I swear I'll run you over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "...Those Infected, huh."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "That day we almost got into a fight. Those people outside... could they have been?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Most likely."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Have they set their sights on Maria as well? Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "...You're overthinking it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Is it gonna rain the day after tomorrow?"
    },
